        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello human! Welcome to D.E.A.T.H.! The Deca centennial Evaluation and Trials of Humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakened in an unknown structure, an alien voice explains that you are responsible for proving humanity is ready to join to the galactic community. Are you merely a rat in a maze, or will you prove that humanity is ready to leave the cosmic zoo?<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>Navigate an alien structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find meaning in the alien symbols around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid an untimely demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the puzzle that confines you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
